          "Offers follow a ritual too. Guests often decline once (\"No, grazie, non si disturbi\") and accept when the host insists; a direct \"Grazie, volentieri\" (thanks, I'd love to) is fine among friends. The best answer to thanks for a favor is \"Ci mancherebbe!\" (don't mention it, it was the least I could do), warmer than a plain \"Prego\".",
